---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Now · Abhivir Singh">
  <div class="editorial-container">
    <section class="pt-20 pb-12 border-b border-border">
      <h1
        class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4"
      >
        Now
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono">
        Last updated: 25 August 2026
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="pt-12 pb-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Building</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">AI agents, seriously:</span> going
              back through the systems I shipped at Fetch.ai and rebuilding the parts I only
              half understood. Harnesses, evaluation, what actually makes a multi-agent system
              hold together at scale.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">The family business:</span> a forging
              works outside Delhi. Reading the books, learning the operation, taking on more of it.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">abhivir.com:</span> this site, kept
              honest.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Recently</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Graduated from Imperial.</span> MEng
              Computing (AI and Machine Learning), First Class Honours. Finished in June,
              conferred in August.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">YC Startup School India:</span> among
              the 25 of 25,000 builders picked for the dinner with YC partners.
              <a href="/blog/india-ai-summit" class="text-foreground hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-2">Writeup</a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Fetch.ai:</span> shipped the
              multi-agent data science platform. <a href="/work/data-pilot" class="text-foreground hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-2">What it does</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Thinking About</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>
              Where to do the next serious thing, and who to do it with.
            </li>
            <li>
              What the first product should be. Education, governance, or something else
              entirely.
            </li>
            <li>
              Finding a co-founder who complements what I'm good at.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Location</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            Faridabad, India. Graduated from Imperial in 2026.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
